From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000003 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 3x-ui TgWeb patchset
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 00:00:02 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] frontend: add portless Telegram WebProxy inbound form

Baseline: MHSanaei/3x-ui@6be3c438e1420f24dd10060f8a1dd620b2d0e73b
Requires: 0001 and 0002.

TgWeb is exposed as a normal inbound choice while keeping Xray-only controls
hidden. Its public endpoint is metadata for link generation; the actual socket
is owned by nginx SNI routing + tgwebproxy-multi.

